    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d60">

                <pb facs="0154" n="34" xml:id="pg34"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/973: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-06-11T16:00:00-05:00">June 11, 1931—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>80. Your 37, June 10, 1 p.m.<anchor n="37" xml:id="d60-f1"/> Negotiations are
                    still proceeding on the questions mentioned in my 73, June 1, 4 p.m.<anchor
                        n="37" xml:id="d60-f2"/> The local representatives believe that their
                    principals in New York will reach a final favorable decision within a few days.
                    If they do not, President Olaya may appeal again to the good offices of the
                    Secretary of State.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
